      "sentence": "block-conformal distance-rank shape bet: per registered held-out segment, m disjoint contiguous W=30-tick reference blocks give per-feature (raw kurtosis, |skew|) medians and |deviation-from-median| distances; p = (1+#{ref |dev| >= live |dev|})/(m+1) is super-uniform under block exchangeability of the m reference blocks and the live window's own distance-to-median statistic (stationarity across the calibration+test span -- the registered regime; O(1/m) qualifier at finite m, not the continuous-p identity exactly); e = kappa*p^(kappa-1) satisfies E[e|H0] <= 1 per feature per window (kappa=0.1, shared K3/K4 derivation); per window, features combine by averaging (never max); across disjoint windows, per-window averages combine by product, a genuine test martingale; contiguity preserves each coordinate's own serial dependence, which is this construction's own answer to C22 (fired on 82% of healthy clustersynth shards, knowledge/stats/shape-clustersynth-2026-08-05) -- validity requires calibration and live to share the same dependence structure (matched process), not a known phi; MISMATCHED calibration/live process is out-of-claim, measured for the record (PREREGISTRATION.md Amendment v2.K6 K6.11). Registered before any run: this candidate's own canonical-severity power is DERIVED NOT_POWERED (Amendment v2.K6 K6.4) -- the class martingale is validity-sound by construction but structurally weak at the class's canonical mixture separation (d=1.5) at the registered W=30.",
